### APPENDIX A — REQUIRED CONTENTS OF A LOSDA

Every LOSDA must contain at least the following elements. The authoritative form is
`templates/LOSDA-TEMPLATE.md`.

| # | Element | Requirement |
|---|---------|-------------|
| A.1 | LOSDA ID | Unique, permanent, in the format `LOSDA-<ISSUER>-<YYYY>-<NNNNNN>` |
| A.2 | Version | `LOSDA-1.0` |
| A.3 | Licensed Work | Repository URL plus commit or release reference |
| A.4 | Author / Issuer | Legal name, identity reference, capacity to issue |
| A.5 | Licensee | Legal name, registration or identity reference, country |
| A.6 | Class | One of the classes in Section 10.14 |
| A.7 | Deployment type | Production, hosted, embedded, internal, distribution, or another stated type |
| A.8 | Territory | Named territories or "Worldwide" |
| A.9 | Field of use | Permitted purpose, product, or market |
| A.10 | Scale limits | Users, seats, instances, requests, revenue, or "unlimited" |
| A.11 | Conditions | Attribution, reporting, security, audit, resale rights |
| A.12 | Fees | Amount, currency, schedule, refunds, or "none" |
| A.13 | Term | Start date, end date or "perpetual", renewal terms |
| A.14 | Effective Date | Date the license takes effect |
| A.15 | Reliance Period | Confirm 180 days or state an alternative |
| A.16 | Verification URL | Stable public verification endpoint |
| A.17 | Signature | Author or authorized signatory, digital signature permitted |
| A.18 | Registry reference | Registry entry hash or canonical record identifier |

A LOSDA missing A.1, A.3, A.4, A.5, A.6, A.13, A.14, A.17, or A.18 is invalid.

