### APPENDIX C — COMPATIBILITY

| License | Can PASVL code be included? | Notes |
|---------|-----------------------------|-------|
| MIT / BSD-2 / BSD-3 / ISC | Yes | Retain notices. Do not relicense the combined work in a way that conflicts. |
| Apache-2.0 | Yes, one-way | Apache terms apply to Apache code; PASVL terms apply to PASVL code. |
| MPL-2.0 | Yes, per-file | Keep file-level boundaries and notices. |
| LGPL-3.0 | Only via dynamic linking | Follow the LGPL's own requirements independently. |
| GPL-2.0 / GPL-3.0 / AGPL-3.0 | No | Incompatible. Do not combine without written permission from the rights holder. |
| PolyForm / BUSL / Elastic-2.0 | Case-by-case | Requires written compatibility assessment. |
| Public domain / CC0 | Yes | Attribution is still required by the PASVL-side obligations. |

